    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just the money. it's everything. i look at my life and i just see a dead end. no matter how much i \"cut a fee\" or \"take a step\", the weight just stays the same. i just want the noise to stop. i just want to stop feeling like i'm failing at everything every single day. it feels like there's no real way to actually escape this loop, you know?",
